{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 zombies. One ticking clock. Armed only with your weapons and survival instincts, you\u2019re dropped into an arena overrun by the undead. Every second counts as the horde grows larger and the pressure builds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for survival</strong> \u2013 Use your weapons and quick reflexes to hold back waves of zombies before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management</strong> \u2013 Collect ammo and medical supplies dropped by fallen enemies to stay in the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced action</strong> \u2013 Keep moving, keep shooting, and don\u2019t let the horde corner you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival challenge</strong> \u2013 Test your nerves under relentless pressure in a race against the clock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SolicitorZ</strong> is an arena-style zombie shooter that challenges your aim, speed, and focus. The question is simple: can you eliminate all 100 zombies before the timer hits zero?\u00a0 \u00a0Good Night and Good Luck.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3339840?t=1760446642","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3339840?t=1760446642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339840/e6b9e418bfde66bd9398de456ced8ec7c4d87ca2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760446642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339840/e6b9e418bfde66bd9398de456ced8ec7c4d87ca2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760446642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You shoot zombies. There is some blood that shoots out from them, but not much. Bodies do not dismember. There is no sexual cont